<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe M3 money supply rises 33.7 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe M3 money supply rises 33.7 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's year-on-year broadly defined M3 money supply grew 33.7 percent in June after a rise of 25.35 percent in May, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>				    June 1996   May 1996    June 1995 M3</p>
<p>(Z$ million)		 19,771.1    18,817.8    14,782.1 M2</p>
<p>    &quot;			  18,156.7    17,241.7    13,384.4 M1</p>
<p>    &quot;			  11,247.1    10,103.1     7,203.8</p>
<p>--Harare Newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9--</p>
</text>
